    </table><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p></div></div>
  <div class="main-content-container" style="z-index:5;position:relative;"><div class="fixed-width-container" style="margin-left:auto;padding-left:0.3in;width:7.67in;box-sizing:content-box;margin-right:auto;padding-right:0.3in;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:19.5pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:19.5pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Q3 2026: Solid performance in a tough environment</font></p><p style="margin-left:9.35pt;tab-size:26.66px;font-size:8pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p>
    <table style="margin-left:auto;border-spacing:0;table-layout:auto;width:100.0%;border-collapse:separate;margin-right:auto;">
     <tr style="visibility:collapse;">
      <td style="width:48%;box-sizing:content-box;"></td>
      <td style="width:1%;box-sizing:content-box;"></td>
      <td style="width:51%;box-sizing:content-box;"></td>
     </tr>
     <tr style="height:14pt;word-break:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:left;">
      <td style="background-color:#e5f5fc;padding-top:0in;text-indent:9.7pt;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0in;"><p style="margin-left:9.7pt;text-indent:0;tab-size:26.66px;font-size:14pt;margin-top:2pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:4pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Financial highlights Q3 2026</font></p><p style="margin-left:9.7pt;text-indent:0;tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">$2,693 million </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">net sales, a</font><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;decrease</font><font style="color:#0000ff;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">of</font><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;0.5%</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font></p><p style="margin-left:9.7pt;text-indent:0;tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">1.1% </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">organic sales </font><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">decrease</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">*</font></p><p style="margin-left:9.7pt;text-indent:0;tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">9.4%</font><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">operating margin,</font><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;9.7%</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;adj. operating margin*</font></p><p style="margin-left:9.7pt;text-indent:0;tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">$2.13 </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">diluted</font><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">EPS, a </font><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">6.8% decrease</font></p></td>
      <td style="padding-top:0in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0in;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:9pt;margin-top:0.4pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p></td>
      <td style="background-color:#e5eaee;padding-top:0in;text-indent:9.65pt;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0in;"><p style="margin-left:9.65pt;text-indent:0;tab-size:26.66px;font-size:14pt;margin-top:2pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:4pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Full year 2026 guidance</font></p><p style="margin-left:9.65pt;text-indent:0;tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#005495;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Around 0%</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">organic sales growth</font></p><p style="margin-left:9.65pt;text-indent:0;tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#005496;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Around 2.5% positive</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;FX impact on net sales</font></p><p style="margin-left:9.7pt;text-indent:0;tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#005496;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Around 10.5%</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">adjusted operating margin</font></p><p style="margin-left:9.65pt;text-indent:0;tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#005496;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Around $1.2 billion</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">operating cash flow</font></p></td>
     </tr>
    </table><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:2pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:2pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="text-indent:14.4pt;tab-size:26.66px;font-size:7pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">All change figures in this release compare to the same period of the previous year except when stated otherwise.</font></p><p style="text-indent:36pt;tab-size:26.66px;font-size:3pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:3pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><h1 style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:16pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:16pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Key business developments in the third quarter of 2026</font></h1><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:0.09999999999999999in;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:9pt;margin-top:3pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:0.09027777777777778in;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#0070c0;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:1.1925508632568698%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:9pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Net sales decreased organically* by 1.1%</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:9pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">,</font><font style="color:#ff0000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:9pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:9pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">which was 0.8pp higher than the global LVP decrease of 1.9% (Mobility Global, Oct 2026) mainly driven by strong performance in Asia. Regional and customer LVP mix is estimated to have impacted sales negatively by around 0.9pp.</font><font style="color:#ff0000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:9pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:9pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Our organic sales* outperformed LVP in Asia excl. China and in China, while it underperformed in EMEA and was about in line with LVP in the Americas. Our strong performance in Asia excl. China was mainly due to India, where we outperformed by 11pp, driven by continued strong market growth in safety content per vehicle, while in China, we outperformed by around 20pp with Chinese OEMs.</font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:0.09999999999999999in;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:9pt;margin-top:3pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:3pt;min-width:0.09027777777777778in;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#0070c0;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:1.1925508632568698%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:9pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Profitability remained strong.</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:9pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:9pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Operating income decreased by 5.0% mainly due to</font><font style="color:#ff0000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:9pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:9pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">the supplier settlement compensation received in Q3 2025. Adjusted operating income* decreased by 3.4%. Operating margin was 9.4% and adjusted operating margin* was 9.7%. ROCE was 24.1% and adjusted ROCE* was 24.4%.</font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:0.09999999999999999in;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:9pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:3pt;min-width:0.09027777777777778in;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#0070c0;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:1.1925508632568698%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:9pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Cash flow remained solid.</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:9pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:9pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Operating cash flow was $239 million compared to $258 million in 2025. Free operating cash flow* was $124 million compared to $153 million in 2025. The leverage ratio* was 1.3x. In the quarter, a dividend of $0.87 per share was paid and 1.23 million shares were repurchased and retired.</font></div></div>
    <table style="margin-left:auto;border-spacing:0;table-layout:auto;width:98.0%;border-collapse:separate;margin-right:auto;">
     <tr style="visibility:collapse;">
      <td style="width:100%;box-sizing:content-box;"></td>
     </tr>
     <tr style="height:8pt;word-break:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:left;">
