     <tr style="height:11pt;background-color:#e5f5fc;word-break:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:left;">
      <td colspan="2" style="padding-top:0in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0in;"><h1 style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Comments from Mikael Bratt, President &amp; CEO</font></h1></td>
      <td rowspan="3" style="padding-top:0in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0in;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p></td>
      <td style="padding-top:0in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0in;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p></td>
     </tr>
     <tr style="height:9pt;background-color:#e5f5fc;word-break:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:left;">
      <td style="padding-top:0in;text-indent:2.9pt;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0in;"><p style="margin-left:2.9pt;text-indent:0;tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:3pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><img src="img180290266_2.jpg" alt="img180290266_2.jpg" style="vertical-align:bottom;width:103px;height:118px;"></p></td>
      <td style="padding-top:0in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0in;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:9pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:3pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">We continued to deliver well across all key areas in the third quarter. Our sales in India grew by nearly 30% and our sales to Chinese OEMs grew by more than 20%. Strong sales growth in Japan contributed to our sales in Asia exceeding China in the quarter. Globally, our organic sales performance exceeded global LVP by around 1pp, significantly outpacing LVP growth in India, Japan and with Chinese OEMs.</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font></p></td>
      <td rowspan="2" style="padding-top:0in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0in;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:9pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:3pt;margin-right:0.0798611111111111in;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">To support our growing partnerships with Chinese OEMs, our innovation capabilities, global competitiveness and long term growth, we opened our second R&amp;D center in China in Q3.</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:9pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:3pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The business environment remains uncertain but we anticipate a strong fourth quarter supported by an increasing number of product launches and significant raw material recoveries.</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:9pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:3pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Throughout the year, cost headwinds have increased materially, mainly related to raw materials, logistics, the recent flooding in Thailand and lower call off accuracy since Q1. We have been able to offset the majority of these cost headwinds mainly through labor efficiency, material savings through Value Engineering and successful negotiations with customers and suppliers. However, the additional headwinds narrows our full year adjusted operating margin expectation to around 10.5%, the low end of our range of around 10.5-11%. We continue to expect unchanged organic sales growth and an operating cash flow of around $1.2 billion.</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:9pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:3pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Based on our full year guidance, we continue to expect strong cash flow for the year, which supports our ambition to provide attractive shareholder returns through share repurchases and dividends.</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:9pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:3pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Finally, I would like to invite you to our 2027 Investor Day, which will take place in Shanghai, China, on April 26 and 27, 2027. It will be held in connection with the Auto Shanghai, the largest and most important auto show in the world.</font></p></td>
     </tr>
     <tr style="height:9pt;background-color:#e5f5fc;word-break:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:left;">
      <td colspan="2" style="padding-top:0in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0in;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:9pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:3pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">We continued to successfully manage geopolitical developments during the quarter, limiting the effects of tariffs, supply chain challenges and raw material price increases. Well-executed cost reduction initiatives and increased engineering income contributed to a third quarter adjusted operating margin of 9.7%.</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:9pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:3pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Our cash flow remained strong, supporting our ambitious shareholder return strategy. Our leverage ratio of 1.3x was almost unchanged compared with the prior quarter, despite repurchasing around 1.23 million shares for $150 million and paying dividends of $63 million in the quarter. Over the last 12 months, we have repurchased 4.14 million shares for $500 million, in addition to paying $258 million in dividends and keeping our debt leverage ratio unchanged.</font></p></td>
     </tr>
    </table><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p></div></div>
  <div class="fixed-width-container" style="margin-left:auto;padding-left:0.3in;width:7.67in;margin-top:auto;box-sizing:content-box;margin-right:auto;padding-right:0.3in;"><div style="z-index:2;flex-direction:column;display:flex;padding-bottom:0.3in;justify-content:flex-end;position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:right;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">1</font></p></div></div>
