     </tr>
     <tr style="height:10pt;background-color:#0042a5;word-break:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:left;">
      <td style="padding-top:0.01in;text-indent:7.2pt;padding-left:0.01in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0.01in;padding-right:0.01in;"><p style="margin-left:7.2pt;text-indent:0;tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10.5pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left; margin-right:0;"><font style="color:#ffffff;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Financial Report July - September 2026</font></p></td>
     </tr>
    </table><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p></div></div>
  <div class="main-content-container" style="z-index:5;position:relative;"><div class="fixed-width-container" style="margin-left:auto;padding-left:0.3in;width:7.67in;box-sizing:content-box;margin-right:auto;padding-right:0.3in;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:16pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:16pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Business and market condition update</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:12pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Supply Chain</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-right:0.2in;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Customer call-off accuracy deteriorated slightly compared to Q3 2025 as well as compared to Q2 2026, driven by development in China. We expect call-off volatility for the full year 2026 on average to be slightly improved compared to 2025. However, the continued significant uncertainty in the geopolitical environment and future changes in tariffs and trade restrictions may lead to more negative call-off volatility.</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:12pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-right:0.2in;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Raw material inflation, geopolitical risks and tariffs</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-right:0.2in;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Raw material price changes had a negative impact on our profitability in the third quarter, with a gross impact of around $42 million. For the full year 2026, we currently estimate a gross impact of around $120 million from higher raw material prices. We expect to be able to continue to mitigate a majority of this headwind, mainly through internal cost reductions, material mix improvements and commercial negotiations with customers and suppliers. Given the continued uncertainty in the geopolitical environment, tariffs and trade restrictions may contribute to a more adverse inflationary environment. We continue to implement productivity and cost-reduction initiatives to offset these cost pressures.</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-right:0.2in;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The tariffs imposed in 2025 negatively impacted our profitability in the third quarter of 2026. We achieved customer compensation for more than 80% of the tariff costs, resulting in a net negative impact after compensation of around $6 million, in line with the net impact in the third quarter of 2025. Including the dilution effect, the impact on operating margin was around 35 bps negative. While it is our ambition and expectation to continue passing tariff costs on to our customers, there is significant uncertainty as future recovery levels may vary. For the full year 2026, we estimate the tariff-related dilution on operating margin will be similar to the around 20 bps experienced for full year 2025.</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-right:0.2in;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Ongoing geopolitical developments, including hostilities in and around the Persian Gulf, have increased uncertainty in the global economic environment. These conditions may affect supply chains, commodity prices, customer demand, and broader market stability. As a result, our current financial guidance reflects the best information available today but may change if these geopolitical dynamics materially affect our operations or the markets in which we operate.</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-right:0.2in;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">We continue to closely monitor both geopolitical developments and the tariff policy environment in order to remain agile and to adjust our commercial and operational responses to any such developments.</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:justify;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:justify;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:justify;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:justify;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:justify;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:7pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">This report includes content supplied by Mobility Global; Copyright &#169; Light Vehicle Production Forecast, January, July and October 2026. All rights reserved.</font></p></div></div>
