      <td style="padding-top:0.01in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0.01in;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Sales by product &#x2013; Airbags, Steering Wheels and Other</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Sales for Airbags, Steering Wheels and Other grew organically* by 0.2% in the quarter. The largest contributors to the increase were side airbags, center airbags, driver airbags and steering wheels, partly offset by declines for passenger airbags, inflatable curtains and knee airbags.</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font></p></td>
      <td style="padding-top:0.01in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0.01in;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p></td>
      <td style="padding-top:0.01in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0.01in;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Sales by product &#x2013; Seatbelt Products and Other</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Sales for Seatbelt Products and Other declined organically* by 3.9% in the quarter. Sales decreased organically in China, Americas and EMEA while they increased in Asia excluding China.</font></p><h2 style="margin-left:33.65pt;tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"></font>&#160;</h2></td>
