      <td style="padding-top:0.01in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:middle;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0.01in;text-align:center;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:9pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:right;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">(4.1)%</font></p></td>
