     <tr style="height:7pt;background-color:#ffffff;word-break:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:left;">
      <td colspan="8" style="padding-top:0.01in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:middle;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0.01in;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:7pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;top:-3.283pt;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:4.69pt;line-height:1.5;position:relative;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">1)</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;Non-GAAP measure, excluding effects from capacity alignments and antitrust related matters. See reconciliation table. </font><font style="color:#000000;top:-3.283pt;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:4.69pt;line-height:1.5;position:relative;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">2)</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;Net of treasury shares.</font></p></td>
