      <td style="padding-top:0.01in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0.01in;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Total equity </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">as of September 30, 2026, decreased by $89 million compared to September 30, 2025. This was mainly due to $505 million in share repurchases, including taxes, and $258 million in dividend payments, partly offset by net income of $623 million.</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Leverage ratio*: </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">On September 30, 2026, the Company had a leverage ratio of 1.3x compared to 1.3x on September 30, 2025, as the 12 months trailing adjusted EBITDA* increased by $26 million while net debt* per the policy decreased by $1 million. Our target is to have a leverage ratio not higher than 1.5x.</font></p></td>
