      <td style="padding-top:0.01in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0.01in;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">As of September 30, 2026, total headcount (Full Time Equivalent) decreased by around 800, or 1.3%, compared to a year earlier. The indirect workforce increased by around 100, or 0.6%. The direct workforce decreased by approximately 1,000, or 2.0%, reflecting continued good productivity development.</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font></p></td>
      <td style="padding-top:0.01in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0.01in;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p></td>
      <td style="padding-top:0.01in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0.01in;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;margin-right:0.07569444444444445in;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Compared to June 30, 2026, total headcount (Full Time Equivalent) increased by around 900, or 1.4%. Indirect headcount increased by around 100, while direct headcount increased by approximately 800.</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;margin-right:0.07569444444444445in;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p></td>
