t-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Inquiries: Media</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Gabriella Etemad</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Senior Vice President Communications</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Tel +46 (0)70 612 6424</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Autoliv, Inc. is obliged to make this information public pursuant to the EU Market Abuse Regulation. The information was submitted for publication, through the agency of the VP of Investor Relations set out above, at 12.00 CEST on October 23, 2026.</font></p></td>
      <td style="padding-top:0.01in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0.01in;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:16pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#0042a5;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Definitions and SEC Filings</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Please refer to </font><font><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">www.autoliv.com</font></font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;or to our Annual Report for definitions of terms used in this report. Autoliv&#x2019;s annual report to stockholders, annual report on Form 10-K, quarterly reports on Form 10-Q, proxy statements, management certifications, press releases, current reports on Form 8-K and other documents filed with the SEC can be obtained free of charge from Autoliv at the Company&#x2019;s address. These documents are also available on the SEC&#x2019;s website </font><font><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">www.sec.gov</font></font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;and on Autoliv&#x2019;s corporate website </font><font><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">www.autoliv.com</font></font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">.</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">This report includes content supplied by Mobility Global; Copyright &#169; Light Vehicle Production Forecast, January, July and October 2026. All rights reserved. Mobility Global is a global supplier of independent industry information. The permission to use Mobility Global copyrighted reports, data and information does not constitute an endorsement or approval by Mobility Global of the manner, format, context, content, conclusion, opinion or viewpoint in which Mobility Global reports, data and information or its derivations are used or referenced herein.</font></p></td>
